{"name": "Powerplay", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/db19e8a3ac95264ce3efe8b913aeb448.poster.avif?t=1785443406\" width=\"1166\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/db19e8a3ac95264ce3efe8b913aeb448.webm?t=1785443406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/db19e8a3ac95264ce3efe8b913aeb448.mp4?t=1785443406\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Powerplay, you will manage the economy and the military strategy of an industrial nation. Build your base and secure key resources, while advancing through a classic technology tree. Define your way to survival in the finite, merciless world of Powerplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"41\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/fd398c11a5208796a23ae5ad2e6fff31.webp?t=1785443406\" width=\"750\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/fe634dcc4d95c8c716d187df7ef79ef0.poster.avif?t=1785443406\" width=\"1166\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/fe634dcc4d95c8c716d187df7ef79ef0.webm?t=1785443406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/fe634dcc4d95c8c716d187df7ef79ef0.mp4?t=1785443406\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, equip, and deploy huge armies using the resources and technology you've developed. Expand your territory or defend your strongholds. Every decision matters, from choosing which weapons to produce to leveraging terrain and supply lines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"41\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/c8345d061228d9efdade6bf6013fddf3.webp?t=1785443406\" width=\"750\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/22dc8598fc83cf9050125826ebc9411b.poster.avif?t=1785443406\" width=\"1166\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/22dc8598fc83cf9050125826ebc9411b.webm?t=1785443406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/22dc8598fc83cf9050125826ebc9411b.mp4?t=1785443406\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Building efficient supply chains is the backbone of Powerplay. Design and optimize networks of conveyor belts to transport raw materials to factories, where they\u2019re transformed into intermediate resources and weapons. The challenge lies in balancing resource allocation and space management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"41\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/cfe91c9f0cd2366ca013bdc2ac53d068.webp?t=1785443406\" width=\"750\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/11d9b7663e229efa494dd2e7279a76a6.poster.avif?t=1785443406\" width=\"1158\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/11d9b7663e229efa494dd2e7279a76a6.webm?t=1785443406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/extras/11d9b7663e229efa494dd2e7279a76a6.mp4?t=1785443406\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A core feature in this game is raw resource locality. You must strategically extract and transport resources to processing facilities to sustain your nation. You must create supply lines and protect them to maintain control of the land.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Classic RTS combat featuring hundreds of units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Isometric camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Conveyor belts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fog of war mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Game editor with elevation support</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Campaign (PvE)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skirmish (single player PvP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game editor sandbox</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Military</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command armies in all domains: Land, air, and sea</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Nuclear weapons</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Powerplay is an RTS with a focus on resources and industry. Create supply chains, transport, and explore in this thrilling base builder. Grow into a powerful industrial nation, but don't spread too thin! Resources are finite and \"the others\" can reclaim what is theirs at any time.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010280/177aea26bbfa44a1ff5d6b5f0cfbd01eec8f2eb0/header.jpg?t=1785443406", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Strategy", "Base Building", "Simulation", "Resource Management", "RTS"], "developers": "Frantic", "publishers": "Frantic", "release_date": "Jul 29, 2026", "price": "$18.99", "appid": "3010280", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "8 October 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/uk58vZvn5PQ", "first_seen": 1759874400.0, "review_rank": 1461}